# Merchant Dashboard Rules (apps/merchant)

## Origin
Forked from `solana-program/subscriptions/webapp`. Keep upstream compatibility where practical.

## Tech Stack
- Vite + React 19
- Tailwind CSS 4 + Radix UI
- TanStack Query for data fetching
- Jotai for client state
- react-router for navigation
- @subscriptions/client for Solana program interaction

## Conventions
- Routes in `src/routes/`
- Components in `src/components/` organized by feature
- Hooks in `src/hooks/`
- Lib/utils in `src/lib/`
- Config in `src/config/`

## Rebrand Checklist
When modifying from upstream, always:
1. Replace "Subscriptions" / "subscriptions" with "Subly" in user-facing text
2. Apply Subly color palette (see `_internal/marketing/brand/GUIDELINES.md`)
3. Keep program interaction logic unchanged — it works with the audited contract

## Key Principle
The program interaction layer (SDK calls, PDA derivation, transaction building) is battle-tested. Don't modify it unless you understand the security implications. Focus changes on UX, branding, and new features (webhooks, analytics, etc.).
